// The CLAIM-CARRY lane's build. Identical compiler options to `tsconfig.json`;
// the only difference is WHAT IT COMPILES — the shared `src/` tree plus this
// lane's own leg, and nothing else.
//
// ⚑ WHY A SECOND CONFIG EXISTS AND WHAT IT IS NOT. Several lanes are live in
// this package at once, and `tsc` over `scripts/**/*` fails the whole build for
// a type error in ANY sibling's in-flight script. That is a build-ordering
// accident, not a fact about this lane's sources, and a lane that cannot build
// cannot measure. This config narrows the file set; it does NOT relax a single
// compiler option, so a type error in `src/` or in this leg still fails here.
{
  "extends": "./tsconfig.json",
  "compilerOptions": {
    "outDir": "./dist-claim"
  },
  "include": ["src/**/*", "scripts/root-claim-carry.ts"]
}
